<title>UK: IADB prices 500 million mark 10-year bond, +16 bp.</title>
<headline>IADB prices 500 million mark 10-year bond, +16 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Morgan Stanley, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER-AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    16.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.98     PAY DATE    16.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    98.98     SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.25 PCT APRIL 2006 BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
